    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 61,
        "text": "Hi, Tom! How was your visit to the new museum yesterday?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "5d86d854dbc543382ca7041c67d697d807bfeb245b6f9a1a43da11fc4e356267",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 67,
        "sourceEnd": 150,
        "text": "It was fascinating, though I have to admit, I almost didn't go because of the rain.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "dea5cbef1632b4375fc9a5451858643876460f890c075182669c93099abe5be5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 156,
        "sourceEnd": 192,
        "text": "Really? I thought you loved museums.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "db395d1483237302c9f06d95a3ac275c4c95970e6d4572d5636100fb84bedb36",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 198,
        "sourceEnd": 319,
        "text": "I do, but the weather was terrible. Anyway, I'm glad I went. The exhibition on ancient Chinese inventions was incredible.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "eecaa6e1d28f496901ad4df1f85114cec52adbf642f4c365390365eb190d2f1a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 325,
        "sourceEnd": 348,
        "text": "What did you like most?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "38885ea95342dd4944baa6c41d6c7169cbaf158eccf652c89ba2d9ddd58db681",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 354,
        "sourceEnd": 466,
        "text": "Well, the display of early compasses was amazing. Although they were simple, they changed navigation completely.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "0e49be568e0ba80ca1501227b536d84135af327037aaf52d331582548595816d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 472,
        "sourceEnd": 533,
        "text": "That sounds interesting. Did they have any interactive parts?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "8d86f7a8e3b6ba6bd11efafafe4e4ab37ef95b8cf35a31a032a2f3ad054d67b0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 539,
        "sourceEnd": 655,
        "text": "Yes, there was a section where you could try using a replica of an old printing press. It was harder than it looked!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "7473cba985dce9f8be8a89066d3987841d6cf549aebb79d12d6a872bfc860283",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 661,
        "sourceEnd": 707,
        "text": "I bet. I heard the museum also has a new café.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "a97ef960631a87e49d36604b3391aadea1c1681adcd678161429f8313ab93b1b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 713,
        "sourceEnd": 863,
        "text": "That's right. The café, which opened last month, serves traditional snacks. I tried some, and they were delicious, even though they were a bit pricey.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "59d1106cfcbbe64b2a6fde7e96d72d1414a2ecbee41505bd492d05e8ba6fe0a9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 869,
        "sourceEnd": 927,
        "text": "Nice. I might go next weekend. Is it crowded on Saturdays?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "b90769352582d64e57d7cbece284608b969b172f213dde32651041f26322cca8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 933,
        "sourceEnd": 1089,
        "text": "It can be, but if you go early in the morning, it's usually quiet. Oh, and don't miss the temporary exhibit on silk road textiles. It's on the second floor.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "f4594529fb48a5e65b8415da4fc163ff2d2aaed7ba4034a762a4cd3c47e7d1ab",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1095,
        "sourceEnd": 1150,
        "text": "Thanks for the tip. By the way, did you go with anyone?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "96435c36d9cd4143ac8a2b4c812b3c213f0b297aa9b54179c1aa080b6b8c2338",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1156,
        "sourceEnd": 1276,
        "text": "No, I went alone, but I met a group of students from a local school. They were there for a project on cultural heritage.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "290b4b0316fb20c0b75779710b70fd6366674573e5f83bc9e31bfa085b8cac85",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1282,
        "sourceEnd": 1329,
        "text": "That's cool. I wish I had more time to explore.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "34dd0f5d4b9629d54d21a00a9ad9f89f90f204c19a9a63101c378074e18e7111",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1335,
        "sourceEnd": 1423,
        "text": "Me too. The museum is huge, and there's so much to see. I only covered about half of it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "c9a44547ce36d2f0dad86b7a5a66a517d6b82a42f9b424d59b21c85adb68a6f0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1429,
        "sourceEnd": 1473,
        "text": "Well, at least you have a reason to go back.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "32322b953abfaa6a57725cd4bf7b1ac0eda095da21d0713d59580132cac69b9d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1479,
        "sourceEnd": 1548,
        "text": "Exactly. Next time, I'll bring my sister, who is really into history.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "52e9e16de7d595464e9a0f2b9ff2b8403617bd5f5cafb95d0f1d15b445b4568f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1554,
        "sourceEnd": 1620,
        "text": "Sounds like a plan. Let me know if you go again; I'd love to join.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "b25766ac1a6931d7bce00dd03ec36440ca69edcea7d48f38514c73c458bb43f4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1626,
        "sourceEnd": 1637,
        "text": "Sure thing!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "25958323046edb6cea4b7a0efca7a8d5f0ec425f4ac00a6e4b25cd03849e92a9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
